      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's getting so quiet outside the gates... like they're just waiting. i can hear them sharpening things. i don't think there's anything left for us here. no food, no hope, just waiting to be slaughtered like animals when they finally break through. i don't want to be there when it happens. i just don't want to see what they do to us.",
